# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Local credentials. These are gitignored, but the build context does not
# honor .gitignore, so without this they end up in an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Python virtualenvs and caches. Host venvs are built for the host's
# interpreter and would clobber the venv the image builds for itself.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache

# Node
**/node_modules
**/coverage

# Not needed by any image at runtime
**/tests
contracts/
docs/
LICENSES/
local_test/
repolinter.json
**/env.sample
**/pyrightconfig.json
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.*

# Editors and local tooling
.idea/
.vscode/
CLAUDE.md
